  "businessLogic": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "step": 1,
        "title": "初始化參數",
        "details": "1.如果參數沒有傳custId，需要從框架內獲取custId\n2.定義 postFix = \"0\";身分標記\n3.定義 originalPostFix = null;\n4. Regex regEx = new Regex(@\"^[A-Z][1289]\\d{8}$\"); //驗證custId"
      },
      {
        "step": 2,
        "title": "處理邏輯",
        "details": "1. custId = custId.ToUpper().Trim();將custId轉大寫\n2.如果custId的長度等於11位\noriginalPostFix = custId.Substring(10, 1);\ncustId = custId.Substring(0, 10).Trim();\nif (custId.Length == 8)\n{\noriginalPostFix = \"  \" + originalPostFix;\n}\n2.如果custId的長度等於9\n直接回傳custId\n3.如果(custId.Length != 8 && custId.Length != 10) 直接回傳null\n4.判斷custId 是否為OBU開頭，如果符合條件postFix賦值為0\nif (Regex.IsMatch(custId, @\"^OBU\\d{5}$\"))\n{\npostFix = \"  0\";\n}\n5.判斷custId是否符合台灣身分證號格式，如果符合執行驗證方法，如果驗證未通過回傳null；如果通過驗證 postFix = \"0\";\nif (Regex.IsMatch(custId, @\"^[A-Z][1-2]\\d{8}$\"))\n{\nif（custId.Length==10並且符合regEx驗證規則）\n{ postFix = \"0\";}\nelse {回傳null；}\n}\n6.判斷custId是否符合2 個大寫英文字母 + 8 個任意數字（0-9），符合條件給postFix賦值\nif (Regex.IsMatch(custId, @\"^[A-Z]{2}\\d{8}$\"))\n{postFix = GetUserForeignerList(custId + \"8\") == string.Empty ? \"0\" :\"8\";}\n7.如果符 (Regex.IsMatch(custId, @\"^\\d{8}[A-Z]{2}$\")),postFix進行賦值\npostFix = GetUserForeignerList(custId + \"8\") == string.Empty ? \"0\" :\"8\";\n8.如果符合(Regex.IsMatch(custId, @\"^[A-Z][89]\\d{8}$\"))\n{\nif（custId.Length==10並且符合regEx驗證規則）\n{ postFix = \"0\";}\nelse {回傳null；}\npostFix = GetUserForeignerList(custId + \"8\") == string.Empty ? \"0\" : \"8\";\n}\n9.如果符合(Regex.IsMatch(custId, @\"^\\d{8}$\") ||  Regex.IsMatch(custId, @\"^[A-Z]{4}\\d{4}$\"))\n{\npostFix = \"  0\";\n}"
      },
      {
        "step": 2,
        "title": "1.IsValidId驗證",
        "details": "1.如果custId.Length==10並且符合regEx驗證規則"
      },
      {
        "step": 3,
        "title": "組合參數",
        "details": "1.如果originalPostFix!=null,進行賦值 postFix = originalPostFix;\n2.custIDFormat=custId + postFix;"
      },
      {
        "step": 4,
        "title": "回傳執行結果",
        "details": "回傳正規化的custId"
      }
    ],
